WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A courtyard at night.

2
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.210
A servant girl says that
Peter was with Jesus.

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.490
Peter answers: Woman, I don't know him.

4
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.570
He says it three times.

5
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.140
Weeks later, Peter stands before the
high priest's family and the Council.

6
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:18.340
They order him to stop
speaking in Jesus' name.

7
00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.020
He goes straight back to
teaching in the Temple.

8
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:23.120
Why does he not back down?

9
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.390
In this mission, you'll map
Peter's first great speech,

10
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.470
at the festival of Pentecost.

11
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.180
Then you'll follow the
arrests, the prison,

12
00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.050
and a respected teacher named Gamaliel.

13
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.960
Your mission: find out why
Peter does not back down.
